# A directory with a qmldir is a MODULE, and a module resolves only the types
# it lists -- the implicit "any .qml file beside me is a type" rule stops
# applying the moment this file exists. Registering the singletons here (which
# is the only way to register a singleton) therefore means registering
# everything else too, or Bar.qml stops being a type the instant Cfg becomes
# one.
singleton Ipc 1.0 Ipc.qml
singleton Cfg 1.0 Cfg.qml
singleton Compositor 1.0 Compositor.qml
Bar 1.0 Bar.qml
Panel 1.0 Panel.qml
Pill 1.0 Pill.qml
Icon 1.0 Icon.qml
Section 1.0 Section.qml
singleton Metrics 1.0 Metrics.qml
Popover 1.0 Popover.qml
singleton Wallpaper 1.0 Wallpaper.qml
singleton Logo 1.0 Logo.qml
Arrange 1.0 Arrange.qml
FormRow 1.0 FormRow.qml
Picker 1.0 Picker.qml
Toggle 1.0 Toggle.qml
Field 1.0 Field.qml
